{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design your own single-celled organism and dive into a vast microscopic world. Eat, fight, and unlock upgrades to survive the dangerous microcosm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize the shape and look of your cell, drag and drop attachments which impacts your stats and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Included in demo:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fine-grained controls over the body's shape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose eating type (herbivore, carnivore, omnivore).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 attachments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">16 body textures.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore procedurally generated worlds, featuring diverse biomes with unique characteristics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Included in demo:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 biomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 dungeon with a boss.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relaxed\u00a0</strong>- Progress is always saved.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Normal\u00a0</strong>- Saves only at checkpoints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hardcore\u00a0</strong>- One life, death is permanent.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3791370?t=1749225634","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3791370?t=1749225634","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791370/e1d18ef3b47ca4e293efbfa0d67db9c5755ec593/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749225634","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791370/e1d18ef3b47ca4e293efbfa0d67db9c5755ec593/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749225634","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design your own single-celled organism and dive into a vast microscopic world. Eat, fight, and unlock upgrades to survive the dangerous microcosm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize the shape and look of your cell, drag and drop attachments which impacts your stats and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Included in demo:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fine-grained controls over the body's shape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose eating type (herbivore, carnivore, omnivore).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 attachments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">16 body textures.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore procedurally generated worlds, featuring diverse biomes with unique characteristics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Included in demo:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 biomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 dungeon with a boss.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relaxed\u00a0</strong>- Progress is always saved.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Normal\u00a0</strong>- Saves only at checkpoints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hardcore\u00a0</strong>- One life, death is permanent.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Murrent"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3520660","name":"Celler"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamst